      "refersTo": "waiting-count",
      "description": "'À tua espera': one linked line per kind of pending work, with a count bubble.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-wait-list\"><li><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-count ds-urgent\">2</span><span class=\"ds-txt\"><b>Pagamentos por fazer</b><small>Envia o comprovativo da transferência.</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></a></li><li><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-count\">1</span><span class=\"ds-txt\"><b>Avaliações por fazer</b><small>Avalia o intérprete depois do serviço.</small></span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></a></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-wait-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;width:340px;font-family:'Public Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#10192d}.ds-wait-list li+li{border-top:1px solid #dde1e9}.ds-wait-list a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:12px 8px;border-radius:6px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-wait-list a:hover{background:rgba(233,241,251,.5)}.ds-wait-list a:hover svg{transform:translateX(2px)}.ds-wait-list a:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #0749ac}.ds-wait-list svg{color:#545d6d;transition:transform 150ms;flex-shrink:0}.ds-count{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:28px;min-width:28px;padding:0 8px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:9999px;background:#e9f1fb;color:#063e93;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-count.ds-urgent{background:rgba(166,87,7,.1);color:#a65707}.ds-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-txt b{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.ds-txt small{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#545d6d;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}"
    }
